//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
//
// File: src/il/runtime/defs/services/services.def
// Purpose: Registry rows and class metadata for Zanna.Services, the
//          provider-neutral platform services layer (Steam first): the
//          platform core, player progress (achievements, stats, leaderboards),
//          platform UI (presence, overlay, text input), and cloud storage.
// Key invariants:
//   - Every C symbol uses the rt_services_ prefix so native links select the
//     zanna_rt_services component archive.
//   - Reference-returning rows declare ownership (ADR 0314); every class has
//     authored summary and details documentation (ADR 0101).
//   - Constant ordinals match rt_services.h, rt_services_progress.h,
//     rt_services_social.h, and rt_steam.h and never change.
// Ownership/Lifetime: Declarative metadata consumed by rtgen.
// Links: docs/adr/0352-platform-services-runtime-loaded-providers.md,
//        docs/adr/0353-platform-services-player-features.md,
//        src/runtime/services/rt_services.h,
//        src/runtime/services/rt_services_progress.h,
//        src/runtime/services/rt_services_social.h,
//        src/runtime/services/rt_services_cloud.h,
//        src/runtime/services/steam/rt_steam.h,
//        docs/zannalib/services.md
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

